menu "Sprout feature modules"

config FEATURE_FORM_FACTOR_PROFILE
    bool "Enable capability-composed form-factor profile"
    default n
    help
        Composes the advertised action set from a body's capability set so the
        same voice, content and platform modules run on a desktop, a moving
        body or a wearable. Swapping a body only swaps the profile and its
        assets; the profile never binds to a character or an appearance.

endmenu
